## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** A provenance-hidden foundation model offered free on OpenCode Zen for a limited feedback period. Not the open-source `exo-explore/exo` distributed-inference project; the name collision is the only link found.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/exo-free`, `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`, `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible`). No vendor attribution, no public endpoint outside Zen.
- **Release / knowledge:** available on Zen now (limited time); exact release date and knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free`.
- **Context window:** not published (absent from Zen docs and models.dev).
